# tracker and carries absolute paths into it.
AGENTS.md

# Agent-to-agent stage work orders. They task a named agent with a session-sized
# scope and route its audit; the work they directed is shipped, the tasking is not.
STAGE3_WORK_ORDER.md
STAGE4_WORK_ORDER.md

